Still playing 3.1.0, eh?  Basically, you're hosed.  This is a bug in
3.1.0. Tourists cannot complete the game because the bad guy doesn't
have the bell and it cannot be wished for.  Get 3.1.1 in which this
bug has been fixed.  

On the subject of quests, as some people have suggested or implied, I
agree that having to be level 15 is bogus.  If the dev team insists on
a level requirement it should be lowered to 10 or something like that.




